<item><title>Djibouti opens study of local materials for construction</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-opens-study-of-local-materials-for-construction-b97c1a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-opens-study-of-local-materials-for-construction-b97c1a/</guid><category>Djibouti</category><description>The government wants to assess resources for building as imported supplies add to construction costs and weigh on access to housing.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:24:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-opens-study-of-local-materials-for-construction-b97c1a/share.jpg" length="41169" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-opens-study-of-local-materials-for-construction-b97c1a/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Djibouti presents carbon initiative to Morocco and Chad</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-presents-carbon-initiative-to-morocco-and-chad-8dac68/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-presents-carbon-initiative-to-morocco-and-chad-8dac68/</guid><category>Djibouti</category><description>Morocco expressed interest in further technical study, while Djibouti and Chad explored cooperation on sovereign climate finance.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:32:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" length="31696" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
